{
  "sections": {
    "customer_care": {
      "type": "customer-care",
      "blocks": {
        "custom_liquid_AcVRHH": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<div id=\"coach-product-care-responsive\" class=\"content-inners\">\n<div class=\"inside-mid\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"dashboard-template__heading zh-all-eng cht-all-eng jp-all-eng ko-all-eng fw-bold inside-head\">How do I treat my bag to some TLC?</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"figure-sec\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/product-care.jpg?v=1746702112\" class=\"w-100\"></div>\n<div class=\"mt-md-5\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"mt-md-5\">\n<div class=\"content-description-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"fw-bold heading-v2\">Start here to find the care you need.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"on-hover-grey mt-3 content-bot-space\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">We offer free lifetime leather care at our Coach Retail stores, but you can also care for your bag at home with our easy tips.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cr-page-sec\">\n<div class=\"responsibility_content responsibility_row leather-content-row\">\n<div class=\"responsibility_inner responsibility_padding leftright\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-rows mt-0 col-sec-space\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one textspace text_contect\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">Coach Leathers</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">Our core leathers, crafted to last a lifetime (with a little love and care along the way).</div>\n<a class=\"helvetica-link cursor-pointer product-care-link\" href=\"#coach-leather\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><a class=\"img-link col-img\" href=\"/\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/leather.jpg?v=1746702112\" alt=\"\" class=\"leather-image\"> </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-rows mt-0 col-sec-space\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><a class=\"img-link col-img\" href=\"/\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/sportcalf.jpg?v=1746702112\" alt=\"\" class=\"leather-image\"> </a></div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one textspace text_contect\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">Sport Calf</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">A classic Coach leather that requires special care, with a vintage look that gets better with age.</div>\n<a class=\"helvetica-link cursor-pointer product-care-link\" href=\"#sport-calf\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-rows mt-0 col-sec-space\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one textspace text_contect\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">Fabrics and Woven Materials</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">Lightweight and low-maintenance materials perfect for everyday style<br><a href=\"/pages/product-care#coach_fabric\"></a>\n</div>\n<a class=\"helvetica-link cursor-pointer product-care-link\" href=\"#fabric\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><a class=\"img-link col-img\" href=\"/\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/fabric.jpg?v=1746702111\" alt=\"\" class=\"leather-image\"> </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-rows mt-0 col-sec-space\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><a class=\"img-link col-img\" href=\"/\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/special.jpg?v=1746702112\" alt=\"\" class=\"leather-image\"> </a></div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one textspace text_contect\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">Specialty Leathers</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">Some leathers require care that’s unique to them (don’t we all?).<br><a href=\"/pages/product-care#coach_fabric\"></a>\n</div>\n<a class=\"helvetica-link cursor-pointer product-care-link\" href=\"#specialty-leather\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-rows mt-0 col-sec-space\">\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one textspace text_contect\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">More Product TLC</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">How to keep sneakers box-fresh, and more.<br><a href=\"/pages/product-care#coach_fabric\"></a>\n</div>\n<a class=\"helvetica-link cursor-pointer product-care-link\" href=\"#more-product\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"coach-care-columns flex-one\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><a class=\"img-link col-img\" href=\"/\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/tlc.jpg?v=1746702112\" alt=\"\" class=\"leather-image\"> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sec-mid-content\" id=\"coach-leather\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-v2\">Coach Leathers</h2>\n<p class=\"para-text toggle-text\">All of our leathers are crafted to last—and naturally, they need a little care from time to time to keep them looking their best. Most of our core Coach leathers can be cleaned with our Coach Leather Cleaner and Coach Leather Moisturizer set.<br><br>Watch the video to see how to give your leather a spa treatment at home.</p>\n<video class=\"video-class\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" loop=\"loop\" alt=\"video content spot\" playsinline=\"\" controls=\"controls\"><source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/1ffe3a8b433749ffbb1c8b26a265c788.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<p class=\"para-text toggle-text mb-60\">You can also visit <a href=\"/pages/store-locator\">your nearest Coach Retail store</a>, and we’ll clean and condition your bag for you. (Appointments are recommended to avoid a wait). No Coach store in your area? We're sorry to hear that. We recommend checking out our <a href=\"#what_are_you_looking_for\">video series</a> with leather expert Debi the Restorer for tips on how to give your bag some TLC at home.<br></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-care\">\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/download.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Glovetanned</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Soft, supple and as durable as its namesake the baseball glove, Glovetanned earned us our name as the Original American House of Leather. (You know when you see someone carrying a gorgeous vintage Coach bag? That’s our Glovetanned Leather). Wear it out to wear it in. It will only get more beautiful with age.</p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/baseball.jpg?v=1746702360\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5rem; max-width: 100%;\">\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch2.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Glovetanned Pebble</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Soft, supple and durable like our Original Glovetanned leather, Glovetanned Pebble features an embossed pebble grain and a silky hand-feel.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/Untitled_design.jpg?v=1784804215'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Regenerative Leather</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>We are proud to partner with the Leather Working Group and Savory Institute to bring regenerative leather into our collections that can help have a positive impact on the environment. Uniquely designed to maintain and rejuvenate grasslands and to increase biological diversity, soil health and productivity, our regenerative leather is soft and easygoing with a lightly pebbled grain.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch3.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Smooth Calf</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Classic and smooth (like the name implies), smooth calf is a fine-grained, durable leather with a polished finish.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details open=\"\">\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch4.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Soft Grain</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Crafted of lightweight goatskin with a special grain, soft grain leather is silky soft with a beautiful drape.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch5-1.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Crossgrain</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Inspired by the everyday hustle, crossgrain is lightweight and durable with a finely grained surface.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch6.jpg?v=1784800732'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Pebble</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Soft and easy going, pebble leather is recognizable by its special pebbled grain.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch7.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Signature Pebble</h3>\n</summary>\n<div>\n<p>Our soft and easygoing pebble leather, embossed with our iconic pattern.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch14.jpg?v=1784800733'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Lambskin Nappa</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p>Crafted from fine-grained Italian lambskin, our nappa has a natural sheen and buttery handfeel. To keep it looking its best, avoid exposure to heat and moisture.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"last_detail\">\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/NATURAL_CALF_LEATHER.jpg?v=1746626730'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Natural Grain Leather</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p>Our Natural Grain Leather features a natural grain texture for that classic leathery feel, as well as semi-vegetable tanning a process that accentuates the unique charm and character of each cut, like variations in shade and color. Because of the nature of the material, it is also prone to abrasion.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"material-margin-top mt-110\" id=\"sport-calf\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-v2\">Sport Calf</h2>\n<p class=\"para-text mb-60\">A cousin of our Glovetanned Leather, Sport Calf is a soft, durable leather with a “vintage” look. To care for it, clean with a damp cloth and moisturize with our <a href=\"/products/coach-moisturizer-coach-moisturizer-224\">Coach Leather Moisturizer.</a></p>\n<div class=\"anacrodo\">\n<div class=\"item\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch8.jpg?v=1784805053'); border-radius: 0; border: none; background-repeat: no-repeat;\">Sport Calf</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"material-margin-top mt-110 gap_detail\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-v2\" id=\"coach_fabric\">Fabric and Woven Materials</h2>\n<p class=\"para-text mb-60\">Bags and accessories crafted in canvas or fabric (including jacquard) can be cleaned with a damp or dry soft cloth.</p>\n<div class=\"Fabric_seCtion\">\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch9.jpg?v=1784805054'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Signature Canvas</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Sturdy and lightweight—and printed with our iconic pattern—Signature canvas is style for your everyday.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch10.jpg?v=1784805053'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Signature Jacquard</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Crafted of fabric woven with our iconic pattern, Signature Jacquard was introduced in 2001 (and still going strong).</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch11.jpg?v=1784805053'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Nylon</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Lightweight and easy to clean, it doesn't get more practical than nylon.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch12.jpg?v=1784805053'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Straw</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">For that carefree summer feeling anywhere, straw is an all-natural and delicate material that should be cleaned and handled carefully.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch13.jpg?v=1784805053'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Denim</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">An enduring symbol of American cool, lightweight and carefree denim is an essential part of our Coach story. Note: colours may transfer to other items.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/0807canvas.jpg?v=1746705699'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Canvas</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Coach canvas is a durable and easygoing material crafted with the everyday in mind. Note: colour may fade naturally over time.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"material-margin-top mt-110\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-v2\">Specialty Leathers</h2>\n<p class=\"para-text mb-60\">The below leathers and materials can be cleaned with a dry cloth, but they also require care that's unique to them (don't we all?).</p>\n<div class=\"Fabric_seCtion\">\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch20.jpg?v=1784806068'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Haircalf</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">This delicate material can also be cleaned professionally. Handle it with care and avoid exposing to moisture.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch15.jpg?v=1784806068'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Suede</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Extra soft and luxurious, Coach suede is durable but should not be exposed to water.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch16.jpg?v=1784806068'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Exotics</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">These delicate leathers should not be exposed to water or moisture. When cleaning, wipe in the direction of the scales.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch17.jpg?v=1784806067'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Shearling</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Shearling is a luxuriously soft material considered a symbol of American cool (and one of our house codes). Shearling can be cleaned professionally.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"tabcare-heading\" style=\"background: url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/swatch18.jpg?v=1784806067'); background-repeat: no-repeat; padding: 1rem; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">Original Natural Leather</h3>\n</summary>\n<div class=\"crafteds\">\n<p class=\"para-text\">Vegetable-tanned and made with all-natural dyes and finishes, Original Natural Leather is made in partnership with a Leather Working Group Gold-Rated tannery (Learn more about what this means here.) Featuring natural marks and wrinkles, this leather will develop its own character over time. Do not expose to water, as colors may run. Do not leave in direct sunlight, as color fading may occur.</p>\n</div>\n</details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-repair-content-container\" id=\"what_are_you_looking_for\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"heading-v2\">Still don’t see what you’re looking for?</div>\n<div class=\"toggle-text\">Contact <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" class=\"link_underline\">Coach Customer Care</a> or visit a store and we'll recommend the right care for your bag. <br role=\"presentation\"><br role=\"presentation\">For frequently asked Coach product care questions, check out our YouTube series with our leather expert Debi the Restorer: <br role=\"presentation\"><br role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=21QSjbjOtMI\" class=\"link_underline\" aria-describedby=\"audioeye_new_window_message\" target=\"_blank\">How to Remove Stains From Your Coach Bag</a> <br role=\"presentation\"><br role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tCUSG5-e27Y\" class=\"link_underline\" aria-describedby=\"audioeye_new_window_message\" target=\"_blank\">How to Store Your Coach Bag</a> <br role=\"presentation\"><br role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UcwxzsI4y58\" class=\"link_underline\" aria-describedby=\"audioeye_new_window_message\" target=\"_blank\">How to Clean and Replace Your Coach Hardware</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"inner-accodian-sec\">\n<h2 id=\"more-product\" class=\"heading-v2 mb-3\">More Product TLC (Including keeping sneakers box-fresh✨)</h2>\n<details class=\"ProductTLC\">\n<summary>Ready-to-wear and soft accessories<span class=\"toggle-icon\"></span></summary>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Each Coach ready-to-wear piece and soft accessory is unique. To learn more about the care of your garment, read the instructions on its care label (sewn to the product). Still have questions? Contact <a class=\"link_underline\" href=\"/pages/contact-us\">Coach Customer Care</a>.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ProductTLC\" open=\"\">\n<summary>Sneakers and shoes<span class=\"toggle-icon\"></span></summary>\n<h5 class=\"title-Medium\">Leather (Sneakers and Dress Shoes)</h5>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Leather dress shoes and sneakers can be cleaned and conditioned with <a href=\"/products/coach-leather-cleaner-223\">Coach Leather Cleaner</a><a class=\"link_underline\" href=\"/products/223\"></a> and <a class=\"link_underline\" href=\"/products/224\">Coach Leather Moisturizer</a>. You can also call to make an appointment at a Coach Retail store, and we'll professionally clean and condition your sneakers for free. (Note: our sneaker-cleaning services in stores are currently on pause, but we look forward to offering them again when it is safe to do so).</p>\n<br role=\"presentation\">\n<h5 class=\"title-Medium\">Suede</h5>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Clean with a suede eraser and brush. Use the eraser to gently rub away spots, then use the brush to remove surface dirt and scuff marks. Brush all over to revive the nap (the soft fibers that give suede its velvety texture).</p>\n<br role=\"presentation\">\n<h5 class=\"title-Medium\">Coated Canvas and Fabric/Jacquard</h5>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Clean with a damp cloth or a soft, dry cloth only.</p>\n<br role=\"presentation\">\n<h5 class=\"title-Medium\">Metallic Leather</h5>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Wipe with a damp cloth. Rub gently to avoid scuffing the metallic finish.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ProductTLC\" open=\"\">\n<summary>Watches<span class=\"toggle-icon\"></span></summary>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Clean and condition leather watchbands with <a href=\"/products/coach-leather-cleaner-223\">Coach Leather Cleaner</a> and <a class=\"link_underline\" href=\"/products/224\">Coach Leather Moisturizer</a>. <br role=\"presentation\">Clean ceramic, rubber and metal watchbands with a soft, damp cloth and a touch of non-moisturized liquid soap if needed. Remove the watchband from the case beforehand. Do not soak the watchband in water (the pins will rust!).</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ProductTLC\">\n<summary>Jewelry<span class=\"toggle-icon\"></span></summary>\n<p class=\"para-text\">We want your Coach jewellery to shine as brightly as you do, so here are couple care tips to keep it looking its best. We recommend removing your jewellery before swimming, bathing or exercising, and limiting exposure to abrasive household cleaners and cosmetic products. Avoid extreme heat and remember to store your pieces in our cotton pouch to prevent tarnishing (our jewellery is protected with anti-tarnish solution but this will help keep it looking fresh over time).</p>\n<h3>14K Gold Jewellery</h3>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Our 14k gold jewellery is crafted to last a lifetime, but a little extra love never hurts! Our gold standard? Keep it shining with a gentle hand soap lather and rinse. Jewellery dips and polishes can contain harsh ingredients so we like to keep it simple—hand-drying with a clean, soft cloth works wonders.</p>\n<h3>Sterling Silver Jewellery</h3>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Your Coach silver wants self-care, too, and a charming sterling piece deserves some special TLC. To give it that award-winning gleam, gently clean with our polishing cloth, rubbing in one direction. We do not recommend using harsh products or fabrics like jewellery cleaner, tissue paper or paper towels.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ProductTLC\">\n<summary>Eyewear<span class=\"toggle-icon\"></span></summary>\n<p class=\"para-text\">Clean Coach eyewear with gentle non-moisturized liquid soap and warm water. Dry with a soft cloth. Avoid using solvents, alcohol or abrasive cloths (they can damage the finish on the lenses).</p>\n</details>\n</div>\n<!-- Explore More Section -->\n<div class=\"customer-detail\">\n<h2 class=\"explore-more-font text-center fw-bolder\">Explore More</h2>\n\n<div class=\"explore-img-container\"><a href=\"/pages/coach-create\" class=\"helvetica-link\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0360/3746/0012/files/care-explore3.jpg?v=1746701198\" class=\"w-100\">\n<p class=\"text-center helvetica-link text-uppercase\">COACH CREATE</p>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<style>\n/* Coach Product Care page responsive styling */\n#coach-product-care-responsive {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 100%;\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive *,\n#coach-product-care-responsive *::before,\n#coach-product-care-responsive *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive img,\n#coach-product-care-responsive video {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive video {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .coach-care-rows {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .coach-care-columns {\n  min-width: 0;\n  flex: 1 1 0;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .leather-image,\n#coach-product-care-responsive .col-img img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .tabcare-heading {\n  background-size: cover !important;\n  background-position: center !important;\n  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;\n  min-height: 64px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .heading-v2 {\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 32px);\n  line-height: 1.25;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .inside-head {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px);\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .para-text,\n#coach-product-care-responsive .toggle-text,\n#coach-product-care-responsive .product-care p {\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .explore-more-container {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .explore-img-container {\n  flex: 1 1 0;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive .explore-img-container img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n#coach-product-care-responsive details > summary {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n  #coach-product-care-responsive {\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    padding-right: 16px;\n  }\n\n  #coach-product-care-responsive .inside-head {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n\n  #coach-product-care-responsive .heading-v2 {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  #coach-product-care-responsive .tabcare-heading {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n 